{"id":"n14010-1-7","stage":3,"title":"연기자 · 演员","scene":"文化与休闲","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n14010-1-7-1","ko":"그 사람은 타고난 연기자야.","zh":"那个人是天生的演员啊。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"그","meaning":"那样，那个","explanation":"그：那样，那个","readings":[{"term":"그","audio":"/audio/38c61820e786f2346e96.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62250","senseId":"2","lemma":"그","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그","audio":"/audio/38c61820e786f2346e96.mp3"}},{"text":"사람은","meaning":"人","explanation":"사람：人；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"사람","audio":"/audio/389e7564ae2551b4f94d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58161","senseId":"1","lemma":"사람","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"사람은","audio":"/audio/987448c10afe56108009.mp3"}},{"text":"타고난","meaning":"先天，天生，与生俱来","explanation":"타고나다：先天，天生，与生俱来；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"타고나다","audio":"/audio/c58b0c98eee5838d6026.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"49265","senseId":"1","lemma":"타고나다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"타고난","audio":"/audio/a977f4a2db19ee6b7bf2.mp3"}},{"text":"연기자야.","meaning":"演员","explanation":"연기자：演员；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；야：非敬语判断或疑问句末，常与 이다 连用。","readings":[{"term":"연기자","audio":"/audio/9ce4e1b8b7f31f50156e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"14010","senseId":"1","lemma":"연기자","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"연기자야","audio":"/audio/1cc6eb3dc93ed6959145.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"38c61820e786f234","term":"그","zh":"那样，那个","audio":"/audio/38c61820e786f2346e96.mp3","entryId":"62250","definition":"指代前面已经讲过或听话人所想的对象。","pronunciation":["그"]},{"id":"389e7564ae2551b4","term":"사람","zh":"人","audio":"/audio/389e7564ae2551b4f94d.mp3","entryId":"58161","definition":"可以思考，会制造并使用语言和工具、构成社会而生活的存在。","pronunciation":["사ː람"]},{"id":"c58b0c98eee5838d","term":"타고나다","zh":"先天，天生，与生俱来","audio":"/audio/c58b0c98eee5838d6026.mp3","entryId":"49265","definition":"性格、才能或命运等生来就具有。","pronunciation":["타고나다"]},{"id":"9ce4e1b8b7f31f50","term":"연기자","zh":"演员","audio":"/audio/9ce4e1b8b7f31f50156e.mp3","entryId":"14010","definition":"以表演作为职业的人。","pronunciation":["연ː기자"]}],"audio":"/audio/8caf5cbd2bc3713cdad0.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n14010-1-7-2","ko":"응, 나도 그렇게 생각해.","zh":"嗯，我也这么觉得。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"응,","meaning":"是，行","explanation":"응：是，行","readings":[{"term":"응","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30205","senseId":"2","lemma":"응","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"응","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3"}},{"text":"나도","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"나도","audio":"/audio/9630a018a2b2bf43a396.mp3"}},{"text":"그렇게","meaning":"那样","explanation":"그렇다：那样；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"그렇다","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61178","senseId":"1","lemma":"그렇다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그렇게","audio":"/audio/b470a873a66143d27846.mp3"}},{"text":"생각해.","meaning":"认为，当作","explanation":"생각하다：认为，当作；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"생각하다","audio":"/audio/6ffd015ff4c3322ac70c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66376","senseId":"7","lemma":"생각하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"생각해","audio":"/audio/ef94867b7401a550a940.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"107dd01c3d38a368","term":"응","zh":"是，行","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3","entryId":"30205","definition":"用于肯定回答对方所提出的问题或命令等。","pronunciation":["응"]},{"id":"1098bbe54520ab2a","term":"나","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3","entryId":"60931","definition":"说话人在朋友或晚辈面前用来指称自己。","pronunciation":["나"]},{"id":"f7c6efa694aaef95","ter